{"3894660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blind Memory", "steam_appid": 3894660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Memory</strong> is an affluent experience to feel <strong>Lost, Chaos and Blinded.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as <strong>Amnesiac</strong> and <strong>Half Blinded</strong> person who wakes up in a weird place knowing nothing about himself Nor about the place where a murder apparently took place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894660/extras/4b6189c19a7b0cb9c3314a976ec7ccb2.avif?t=1767759552\" width=1600 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, Your choices now will shape your destiny—they’ll define who you are and how far you’ve come. But hold on tight… the journey’s just getting interesting, and the best surprises are yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894660/extras/3a9367f0fd173a774943875b22c5137b.avif?t=1767759552\" width=1600 height=772 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blind Memory Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Dual-Perspective Gameplay – Mix of 3D exploration + 2D scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Amnesia + Time Loops – unraveling mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Atmospheric Horror – Focus on sound design &amp; visual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Narrative Twists – mind-bending experience where nothing is as it seems.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894660/extras/2fc17821c26aa0d169b026e82c755617.avif?t=1767759552\" width=1232 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot; What matters more now? The Ghost of Yesterday OR The Breath of Present &quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Memory</strong> is an affluent experience to feel <strong>Lost, Chaos and Blinded.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as <strong>Amnesiac</strong> and <strong>Half Blinded</strong> person who wakes up in a weird place knowing nothing about himself Nor about the place where a murder apparently took place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894660/extras/4b6189c19a7b0cb9c3314a976ec7ccb2.avif?t=1767759552\" width=1600 height=788 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, Your choices now will shape your destiny—they’ll define who you are and how far you’ve come. But hold on tight… the journey’s just getting interesting, and the best surprises are yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894660/extras/3a9367f0fd173a774943875b22c5137b.avif?t=1767759552\" width=1600 height=772 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blind Memory Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Dual-Perspective Gameplay – Mix of 3D exploration + 2D scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Amnesia + Time Loops – unraveling mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Atmospheric Horror – Focus on sound design &amp; visual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Narrative Twists – mind-bending experience where nothing is as it seems.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/